<title>FINLAND: AAMULEHTI SAYS SOLD ALDATA FOR FIM 64 MLN.</title>
<headline>AAMULEHTI SAYS SOLD ALDATA FOR FIM 64 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish media group Aamulehti-yhtyma Oy said in a statement on Wednesday that the price for Aldata Oy in a previously announced deal was 64 million markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
